{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puk\u00e9moe Card Shop Multiplayer is a trading card shop simulation where you sell card  packs to earn money and build your card shop business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875Banner3_EN.jpg?t=1741774544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own Puk\u00e9moe card shop. Organize shelves and card packs to make customer shopping experience smooth and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/shop.gif?t=1741774544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875Banner4_EN.jpg?t=1741774544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy opening cards packs as much as you want to. Test your luck and find super rare cards to complete your Puk\u00e9moe card collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875Banner5_EN.jpg?t=1741774544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the cards as the bet, play card battles with NPC and your friends. If you win, you can take their cards into your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875Banner6_EN.jpg?t=1741774544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the street to find treasures, interesting random activities awaiting, more hiding secrets. Remember that 'LUCK determines a lot'!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569500?t=1741774544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569500?t=